---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import { business } from '../site';
const hasContact = Boolean(business.email || business.whatsapp);
---
<Site title="Contact — MooonStoreClinic"><section class="wrap prose section"><p class="eyebrow">LET'S DEFINE THE FIRST STEP</p><h1>Start with your page.</h1><p class="lede">A URL and a clear goal are enough to begin a conversation.</p>{hasContact ? <div class="actions">{business.email && <a class="button" href={`mailto:${business.email}?subject=Product-page%20review%20enquiry`}>Email Mooon ↗</a>}{business.whatsapp && <a class="text-link" href={business.whatsapp} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Continue on WhatsApp ↗</a>}</div> : <aside class="notice"><b>Enquiries are not open on this website yet.</b><p>If Mooon shared this page with you, reply in your existing conversation. The brief below stays on your device and is not submitted to us.</p></aside>}{business.email && <p>Email: <a href={`mailto:${business.email}`} style="overflow-wrap: anywhere">{business.email}</a></p>}<h2>Your review brief</h2><p>Copy these questions into your message, or download them for later.</p><ol><li>What is your product-page URL?</li><li>Which market and language do you serve?</li><li>What should visitors understand or do next?</li><li>What specific difficulty have you noticed?</li><li>Do you have a preferred time frame?</li></ol><a class="text-link" href="/review-brief.txt" download>Download the brief (.txt) ↓</a><p class="micro">Do not include passwords, payment details or customer data. Downloading the brief does not send an enquiry or create an order.</p><h2>What happens next?</h2><p>We confirm fit and scope, then agree a written quote and payment terms before starting. No payment is collected on this website.</p></section></Site>